---
const rockURL = 'https://russound.com/products/5r82mk2-s-8-2-way-outback-rock-speaker-sandstone/';
---
<section class="rf-outdoor" id="outdoor" aria-labelledby="outdoor-heading">
  <div class="rf-outdoor-heading d-wrap"><p class="d-kicker">Listening beyond the walls</p><h2 id="outdoor-heading">Stay for one more song.</h2></div>
  <figure><img src="/refinement29/outdoor-group-rock.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="Four friends gathering around a fire on a lakeside patio, with a sandstone rock speaker in the garden at the right" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><span>The gathering moves outside. The music comes with you.</span><a href={rockURL}>Meet the 5R82mk2-S rock speaker <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure>
  <div class="rf-outdoor-ending d-wrap"><p>Sound that belongs in the landscape, for the moments you wish would last a little longer.</p><a class="d-link" href="/catalog/?family=speakers&use=outdoors">Explore outdoor sound <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>
<style>
.rf-outdoor{padding-top:clamp(65px,8vw,130px);background:#ece5d9;color:var(--ink);scroll-margin-top:0}.rf-outdoor-heading{padding-bottom:40px}.rf-outdoor h2{font-size:clamp(39px,5.5vw,84px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0}.rf-outdoor figure{margin:0}.rf-outdoor figure>img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.rf-outdoor figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:22px var(--gutter);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.rf-outdoor figcaption a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.rf-outdoor-ending{padding-top:42px;padding-bottom:58px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:32px}.rf-outdoor-ending>p{max-width:44ch;font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.rf-outdoor-ending .d-link{flex-shrink:0}.rf-outdoor a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand-blue);outline-offset:6px}
@media(max-width:760px){.rf-outdoor-heading{padding-bottom:28px}.rf-outdoor figcaption{flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:11px}.rf-outdoor-ending{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:42px}}
</style>
